\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Region Time Counter is a REAPER ReaScript for browsing markers and regions, selecting regions, and calculating the total and selected timeline duration without double-counting overlapping regions. Features searchable marker/region lists, per-project checked state, REAPER custom color swatches and double-click timeline navigation. Requires ReaImGui. No SWS or js_ReaScriptAPI required. License: MIT. Documentation: https://github.com/patch-34/patch34-reapack\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
