\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Patch34 Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Patch34 Scripts} is a collection of Lua ReaScripts and JSFX for REAPER, developed by sound designer Aleksei Vorobev.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The collection includes tools for audio editing, timeline navigation, project organization, workflow automation, and experimental sound design.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Each tool is developed as an independent utility, with a focus on clear functionality, straightforward controls, and integration into everyday REAPER workflows.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Author:} {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/patch-34"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
Aleksei Vorobev / Patch34
}}}
\par}
}
